      "blurb": "Quarian technical specialist and battlefield engineer",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Quarian mechanics combine frontier engineering competence with combat training developed out of necessity on the Migrant Fleet. They favor omni-tool weaponry and technical disruption over direct fire, and they are considerably harder to kill than their combat statistics suggest-their suit integrity training means they handle hostile environments and toxins with unusual resilience.</p><p><strong>Omni-Tool Overload:</strong> See action entry. Disrupts enemy kinetic barriers and electronics.</p><p><strong>Suit Integrity:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus to Fortitude saves against disease and poison.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 30 Shield HP. Recharges 9 HP per turn.</p>",
