        "slug": "omni-tool-overload",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Omni-Tool Overload</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p><strong>Range</strong> 30 feet. One creature with a kinetic barrier or electronic device.</p><p>The mechanic sends a targeted electromagnetic disruption through the target's systems. The target must succeed at a Reflex save (DC 18) or have their kinetic barrier disrupted, losing 2d6 Shield HP (or the effect determined by the GM for other electronics). On a critical failure, the barrier is also briefly offline and does not recharge until the start of the target's next turn.</p>",
